HB0330 Probate code revisions-2.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Schmid, Brady, Campbell, K and
McCann and Senator(s) Hutchings and Pearson
AN ACT relating to the probate code; amending maximum values for certain
proceedings relating to the probate of estates; clarifying the effect of certain
disclaimers of property; and providing for an effective date.
